Local patches to the detector relative to the Impeccable source:
- Removed the Bun.WebView renderer (`render/webview.ts`) and `render/probe-placement.ts` with its test. Added `render/native-browser.ts` for the OMP native browser.
- `snapshot/collect.ts` uses page-side structural types instead of DOM lib types, and records coverage.
- `types.ts` adds `Finding.blocking`, `PageSnapshot.coverage` and `SnapshotCoverage`.
- `policy.ts` holds the objective blocker rules. `lint.ts` sets `blocking`, and `hasBlockingFindings` replaces `hasFailures`.
- `report.ts` adds `DetectReport`, per-capture surfaces, coverage limits, the JSON report and a scope note.
- `detect.ts` requires a renderer, leaves closing it to the caller, and returns a `DetectReport`.
- `cli.ts` lints snapshot JSON and source text, never renders, and uses the new exit codes. `snapshot/validate.ts` and `core/guards.ts` are new.
- `render/renderer.ts` sets `globalThis.__detectContentStress` for owned tabs only. `index.ts` exports the new API and `SCRIPT_ERROR_PROBE` and drops `createWebViewRenderer`.
